  "notes": "CONJUGATION: {仰|あお}ぐ is a godan verb (ぐ row). Te-form: {仰|あお}いで. Passive: {仰|あお}がれる.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {空|そら}を{仰|あお}ぐ (to look up at the sky)\n- {師|し}と{仰|あお}ぐ (to revere as a teacher)\n- {指示|しじ}を{仰|あお}ぐ (to seek instructions)\n- {判断|はんだん}を{仰|あお}ぐ (to ask for a judgment)\n\nDISTINCTION: Not to be confused with {扇|あお}ぐ (to fan), which is a different word written with a different kanji.",
